import {LightningElement} from 'lwc'; import {gql,executeMutation} from 'lightning/graphql';export default class Probe extends LightningElement { result='pending';async connectedCallback(){let out={};let factories={mutation:()=>gql`mutation M { uiapi { bogus } }`,query:()=>gql`query Q { uiapi { bogus } }`,bad:()=>gql`mutation {`};for(const [name,create] of Object.entries(factories)){try{let d=create();out[name]={type:typeof d,isNull:d===null,isUndefined:d===undefined,then:typeof d?.then,keys:d==null?[]:Object.keys(d),kind:d?.kind,operation:d?.definitions?.[0]?.operation};if(name==='mutation'){try{let v=await executeMutation({query:d});out[name].result=v;}catch(e){out[name].rejected={name:e.name,message:e.message};}}}catch(e){out[name]={error:{name:e.name,message:e.message}};}}this.result=JSON.stringify(out);} }